{"title": "Cloudburst causes destruction in Jammu and Kashmir's Doda district", "summary": "A cloudburst and torrential rains triggered mudslides and flash floods in the Thathri town of Doda district, Jammu and Kashmir. The event led to houses, shops, and vehicles being submerged under debris, and caused the closure of the Doda-Kishtwar national highway at multiple points. The Lieutenant Governor of Jammu and Kashmir stated there were no casualties and directed the district administration to expedite relief and restoration efforts.", "summary_points": ["A cloudburst and heavy rains caused mudslides and flash floods in Doda's Thathri town.", "Houses, shops, and vehicles were submerged or buried under debris.", "The Doda-Kishtwar national highway was closed at several locations.", "No casualties were reported, according to the Lieutenant Governor.", "Authorities have been directed to speed up relief and restoration work."], "title_hi": "जम्मू और कश्मीर के डोडा जिले में बादल फटने से तबाही", "summary_hi": "जम्मू और कश्मीर के डोडा जिले के थथरी कस्बे में बादल फटने और भारी बारिश के कारण भूस्खलन और अचानक बाढ़ आ गई। इस घटना में घरों, दुकानों और वाहनों के मलबे में दब जाने से भारी तबाही हुई, और डोडा-किश्तवाड़ राष्ट्रीय राजमार्ग कई स्थानों पर बंद कर दिया गया। जम्मू और कश्मीर के उपराज्यपाल ने बताया कि कोई हताहत नहीं हुआ है और जिला प्रशासन को राहत एवं बहाली कार्यों में तेजी लाने का निर्देश दिया है।", "summary_points_hi": ["डोडा के थथरी कस्बे में बादल फटने और भारी बारिश से भूस्खलन और अचानक बाढ़ आई।", "घरों, दुकानों और वाहनों के मलबे में दब जाने से भारी तबाही हुई।", "डोडा-किश्तवाड़ राष्ट्रीय राजमार्ग कई स्थानों पर बंद कर दिया गया।", "उपराज्यपाल के अनुसार, किसी के हताहत होने की सूचना नहीं है।", "राहत और बहाली कार्यों में तेजी लाने के निर्देश दिए गए हैं।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets focused on the destruction caused by the natural disaster, highlighting the damage to property and infrastructure like the national highway.", "center": "Centrist coverage emphasized the destruction caused by heavy rains and flash floods, noting the damage to homes and shops and the closure of the highway."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वाम-झुकाव वाले आउटलेट्स ने प्राकृतिक आपदा से हुई तबाही पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया, जिसमें संपत्ति और राष्ट्रीय राजमार्ग जैसे बुनियादी ढांचे को हुए नुकसान पर प्रकाश डाला गया।", "center": "केंद्रित कवरेज ने भारी बारिश और अचानक आई बाढ़ से हुई तबाही पर जोर दिया, जिसमें घरों और दुकानों को हुए नुकसान और राजमार्ग के बंद होने का उल्लेख किया गया।"}, "topic": "Environment", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/2ac4r3/article71192317.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/PTI07_07_2026_000100B.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Reuters", "owner": "Reuters", "lean": "international", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTFBjeXBhZG5kOTJIcGtmTGJCcVZYNnQ4X3pCaDZTcHJvV3JBREN6enFqWUZiR3pVVEhWN2V0bUtVcVZTMlZtNzJqaXotUHAyRWZ6dWVFQXlhU202cmpUenhUbnhreTRTczQ?oc=5", "headline": "Floods, damage mount as extreme weather batters India"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Flash floods sweep through Thathri in Doda; Widespread damage reported, Highway closed"}, {"source": "Greater Kashmir", "owner": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Heavy rains, flash flood cause massive destruction in Doda's Thathri; houses, shops buried, highway closed"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/jammu-and-kashmir/doda-jammu-and-kashmir-flood-rainfall/article71192298.ece", "headline": "Houses, shops hit by mudslides in J&K’s Doda after cloudburst, torrential rains"}, {"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/shorts/jk-flash-flood-landslide-hit-dodas-thatri-nh-244-closed/article7119